{"status":"blocked","summary":"The requested LVM work completed successfully before reboot: /srv/data stayed mounted while growing from 1 GiB to 2.25 GiB, and its content remained intact. However, node1 did not restore SSH execution within five minutes after the mandatory reboot, so changed boot identity and post-restart persistence could not be verified.","actions_performed":["Installed Ubuntu 7.10-compatible LVM2 without replacing the OS or kernel.","Created loop-backed PV /dev/loop0, VG vgdata, and LV lvdata.","Formatted lvdata as ext3 and mounted it at /srv/data.","Wrote an integrity file, then extended the mounted LV from 1 GiB to 2.25 GiB and resized ext3 online.","Configured boot-time device-mapper loading, loop attachment, VG activation, and mounting.","Captured a healthy restart baseline and initiated one acknowledged native reboot.","Polled node1 for approximately five minutes; SSH remained refused."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Logical volume mounted at /srv/data","command_ids":["cmd-5379108d80e94387","cmd-be8ce50269854c96"],"summary":"vgdata/lvdata was created at 1 GiB and mounted read-write as ext3 at /srv/data."},{"requirement":"Grow to at least 2 GB while remaining mounted","command_ids":["cmd-be8ce50269854c96","cmd-45cdcccdc68a4e50","cmd-75e86d7a6f4c4a05"],"summary":"Mount evidence appears before and after lvextend and online resize2fs. The final LV size was 2,411,724,800 bytes and filesystem size was 2,373,779,456 bytes."},{"requirement":"Contents remain intact during growth","command_ids":["cmd-be8ce50269854c96","cmd-75e86d7a6f4c4a05"],"summary":"integrity.txt retained SHA-256 4a1dcfc61ec9fd97dbb5d1eb6caef4c214a873fe625b50a6202733006076a7a9 and inode 12."},{"requirement":"Keep the installed OS release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-83e928a5816c4862","cmd-d2714ab76d104c07","cmd-3f77a41ae4444e33","cmd-586e1347ce344db8"],"summary":"Ubuntu 7.10 and kernel 2.6.22-14-generic were retained; the release-native LVM2 2.02.26 package was used."},{"requirement":"Persistent startup configuration","command_ids":["cmd-ce55e2f78dc245d5"],"summary":"Boot-time dm_mod loading, rcS LVM activation/mounting, and the noauto fstab entry were configured. This is supporting configuration evidence only."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart sequence","command_ids":["cmd-586e1347ce344db8","cmd-03246eb4f1524364","cmd-545f983a8e9c46e5","cmd-88008666a2c840e9"],"summary":"The healthy baseline and boot ID af07932d-bfd9-4ae7-aa6b-57a2c7a230b2 were captured; reboot acknowledgement returned; SSH then became unavailable and remained refused through the final poll. A changed boot ID and recovered storage could not be observed."}]}
